                                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Mobile-First Touch Architecture</h4>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                                        Never hardcode desktop heights. Every interactive element starts with mobile constraints (min 44px tap targets, pb-safe padding for iOS home bars) and progressively expands with sm: and md: breakpoints.
