                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                        <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">5</span>
                                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Bento Grid & Spotlight Glows</h4>
